{"id": "C1-10:40", "en": "Your encouragement helped me keep up with my studies.", "p": [["S", "Your encouragement", "senin cesaretlendirmen"], ["V", "helped", "yardımcı oldu"], ["O", "me", "bana"], ["V", "keep up", "geride kalmamama"], ["EK", "with my studies", "derslerimde"]]}
